  "title": "Get Back/Let It Be sessions: day 10 | 1969",
  "date": "1969-01-16",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The tenth day of the <a href=\"/features/get-back-let-it-be-sessions-complete-song-list/\"><em>Get Back</em>/<em>Let It Be</em> sessions</a> was the final one at Twickenham Film Studios. <span id=\"more-101409\"></span></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_04/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-101418\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"101418\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1036\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04-960x518.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/690116-get-back_04-960x518.jpg\" alt=\"Paul McCartney – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" width=\"800\" height=\"432\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-101418\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04-960x518.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04-580x313.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04-200x108.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04-768x414.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04-1536x829.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_04.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>The Beatles had decided to relocate to the basement studio at their Apple Corps headquarters at 3 Savile Row, London, a condition of <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> rejoining. Harrison had walked out of the band on <a href=\"/1969/01/10/george-harrison-quits-the-beatles/\">10 January 1969</a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/01/16/get-back-let-it-be-sessions-day-10/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-101409 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTA4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEwOCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-200x108.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Mal Evans – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-200x108.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-580x313.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-960x518.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-768x414.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-1536x829.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-300x160.jpg 300w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"101415\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1036\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Mal Evans – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_01-960x518.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon 