//www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_13-960x518.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_13-768x414.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_13-1536x829.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_13-300x160.jpg 300w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_13.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"101427\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_13/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_13.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1036\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Kevin Harrington – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_13-960x518.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_15/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTA4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEwOCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-200x108.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Mal Evans – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-200x108.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-580x313.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-960x518.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-768x414.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-1536x829.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-300x160.jpg 300w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"101429\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_15/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1036\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Mal Evans – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_15-960x518.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>On this day, 16 January 1969, the set at Twickenham was dismantled by Mal Evans, Kevin Harrington, and Glyn Johns. The Beatles were not scheduled to attend, but <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> turned up to record a piano demo of the future <a href=\"/albums/abbey-road/\"><em>Abbey Road</em></a> song <a href=\"/songs/oh-darling/\">‘Oh! Darling’</a>.</p><p>The demo recording, produced and engineered by Glyn Johns, was shown in Peter Jackson’s 2021 documentary <em>Get Back</em>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/01/16/get-back-let-it-be-sessions-day-10/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-101409 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTA4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEwOCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-200x108.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Glyn Johns – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-200x108.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-580x313.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-960x518.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-768x414.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-1536x829.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-300x160.jpg 300w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"101419\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1036\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Glyn Johns – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_05-960x518.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690116-get-back_06/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTA4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEwOCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"108\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_06-200x108.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Glyn Johns – Twickenham Film Studios, 16 January 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_06-200x108.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_06-580x313.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690116-get-back_06-960x518.jpg 960w, https://ww